# mysql-ddl:2026-08-18 本机复现
机器: Apple Silicon(M1 Pro), macOS, OrbStack docker, mysql:8.0 镜像(8.0.46)
复现方式: experiments/mysql-ddl/run_all.sh 自动化三会话时序(A 长事务→B ALTER→C 观察)

## 结果
- 01_setup: 20 万行表建好
- 会话 B 的 ALTER(lock_wait_timeout=20): ERROR 1205 (HY000) Lock wait timeout exceeded
- 会话 C 观察(04_watch.out):
  - processlist: ALTER 处于 "Waiting for table metadata lock"
  - metadata_locks: big_table SHARED_READ GRANTED(会话 A) + SHARED_UPGRADABLE GRANTED(ALTER 执行期) + EXCLUSIVE PENDING(提交切换升级被挡)
- 负对照(03_negative.out): A 事务结束后同一条 ALTER 1 秒成功
- 05_algorithm_compare: 8.0.46 上 INSTANT/INPLACE/COPY 三条 ALTER 全成功;
  表 198900 行, DATA_LENGTH=21544960, INDEX_LENGTH=17858560
